# SHA-256 of every file of plugins/codex/ (D41, D78, D104). Codex 0.154's hook trust
# hash covers only the hook declarations (codex-trust.sha256), but newer Codex versions
# also hash every file of the plugin root, so any byte change would turn the hooks off
# until the user trusts them again. A change to plugins/codex/ updates this list in the
# same reviewed change until E2E-9 freezes the root (D61); after the freeze it never changes.
